name: Bounded citation inspection, truthful partial work and immutable finding history
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/citation_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: run findings:ground {"limit":1}
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Additional ledger candidates | limited
expect: checked 1 citation(s)
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/citation_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART limited
ask: Does the bounded window disclose unchecked candidates without claiming repository coverage or changing finding verdicts?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/citation_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART change-citations
paste-file: @ART/ground-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 unavailable=1 | changed
expect: file_missing=1
expect: line_drift=1
expect: Finding verdicts remain unchanged
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/citation_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART changed
ask: Can the operator distinguish a stale anchor, missing file and unavailable source, with preserved raw observations and source-bound inspection receipts?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: inspection-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: inspection-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: inspection-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: inspection-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: inspection-40x12
keys: Escape
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | expanded-inspection-40x12
keys: PPage PPage
live-snap: inspection-page-40x12
ask: Are the result, uncertainty and paging readable across all six sizes, with no completed Review claim?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/ground-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 unavailable=1 | repeated
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/citation_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART repeat
paste-file: @ART/import-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM | import-review
keys: y
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 imported 3 finding(s) | imported-again
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/citation_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART imported-again
ask: Do repeated checks stay idempotent for the same source, and does explicit import preserve existing observations and auxiliary phase ownership?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | no-color-ready
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 20 citation fixture | no-color-findings
expect-not: Map ✓
expect-not: Scan ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/citation_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recovered
ask: Does restart retain all three original findings and the two source-bound citation audits without scans or model work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
